#
# In this file (gap/data.gi) you will find:
#
# Generators of space groups in 4x4 matrix form
# PGGens230   ----- List of variable names for the generators of the space groups
# IWP         ----- List of wyckoff positions, defined as the fixed points of the group elements recorded in this list
# Generators of the mod-2 cohomology ring for space groups in function form: explict cochain expressions up to 3-cocycles
# GENNAMES    ----- List of strings for the explicit cocycles, for print-out use
# funcs230    ----- List of variable names for the explicit cocycle functions
#
#
#
#








